{"id": "115-1-D-049", "year": 115, "session": 1, "subject": "D", "number": 49, "stem": "氫原子（\n1\nH）的旋磁比（gyromagnetic ratio）為42.6 MHz/T，鈉原子（\n23\nNa）的旋磁比為11.3 MHz/T，下\n列何者錯誤？", "options": {"A": "3 T 磁場下，氫原子的旋進頻率為127.8 MHz", "B": "1.5 T 磁場下，鈉原子的旋進頻率為 16.95 MHz", "C": "3 T 磁場下，鈉原子的旋進頻率為22.6 MHz", "D": "1.5 T 磁場下，氫原子的旋進頻率為 63.9 MHz"}, "answer": "C", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/115_1/0603_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
